        "column_2_align_desktop": "center",
        "column_2_html": "<div class=\"why-this-matters-container\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none\">\n  <h2>He made ordinary life better</h2>\n  <div class=\"space-y-4 font-sans text-[#636E72] leading-relaxed\">\n    <p>\n      What I'll always remember is how he felt. Dense and powerful, a born athlete. I could say \"get the ball\" and he was already gone, and he could swim all day: pool, beach, lake, didn't matter. But so kind, so sweet. Perfect to me in every way.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      A coffee run was better because Oxmo was there. A drive was more fun. Some of my favorite memories are simply the two of us exploring parks and hiking together, and just taking a seat, being with him.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
